    # KYLISA @ talk "You have returned... How may I help you?"
    KYLISA @ talk "Vous êtes de retour... Comment puis-je vous aider ?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:42
translate fr kylisa_bye_9bb97fc5:

    # KYLISA @ talk "May the blessings of the gods be with you."
    KYLISA @ talk "Que les bénédictions des dieux soient avec vous."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:46
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_52dd919a:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I am the royal Mage, but given the... {i}change in leadership,{/i}"
    KYLISA @ talk "Je suis le mage royal, mais étant donné le... {i}changement de direction,{/i}"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:47
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_e97fcb71:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I now serve at the Emperor's pleasure."
    KYLISA @ talk "Je sers maintenant au bon plaisir de l'Empereur."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:50
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_d2173e34:

    # KYLISA @ angry "You should be careful asking such questions..."
    KYLISA @ angry "Vous devriez faire attention en posant de telles questions..."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:51
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_32ed9419:

    # KYLISA @ angry "One could take that question the wrong way."
    KYLISA @ angry "On pourrait prendre cette question de travers."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:52
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_b11273ac:

    # MC @ talk "Forgive me, I did not mean any ill with it."
    MC @ talk "Pardonnez-moi, je ne voulais pas mal faire."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:53
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_94c63cb9:

    # KYLISA @ sad "...He was kinder."
    KYLISA @ sad "...Il était plus gentil."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:54
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_037383db:

    # KYLISA @ sad "Most talk of how Alcott saved us all and Mesamore would have doomed us all."
    KYLISA @ sad "La plupart racontent comment Alcott nous a tous sauvés et que Mesamore nous aurait tous condamnés."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:55
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_badfec21:

    # KYLISA @ sad "But many forget how we prospered under Mesamore before."
    KYLISA @ sad "Mais beaucoup oublient à quel point nous prospérions sous Mesamore auparavant."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:56
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_676e62d6:

    # KYLISA @ sad "He was a kind king, one determined to tackle poverty in ways his predecessors never did, and life was good under him."
    KYLISA @ sad "C'était un roi bon, déterminé à lutter contre la pauvreté comme ses prédécesseurs ne l'avaient jamais fait, et la vie était agréable sous son règne."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:57
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_e9272224:

    # KYLISA @ sad "He may not he been the strongest military mind, but what king could have ever been prepared for the threat of the Demorai in such short notice?"
    KYLISA @ sad "Il n'était peut-être pas le plus grand stratège militaire, mais quel roi aurait pu se préparer à la menace des Demorai en si peu de temps ?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:58
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_86eb7477:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Alcott tried time and time again to push for more control over the lives of the realms citizens, and each time, Mesamore pushed back."
    KYLISA @ talk "Alcott a maintes fois tenté d’obtenir plus de contrôle sur la vie des citoyens du royaume, et à chaque fois, Mesamore s’y est opposé."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:59
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_66935207:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Despite the war he faced, Mesamore always wanted us to see a future beyond it, he never wanted the realm to become nothing but the violent war machine it is today."
    KYLISA @ talk "Malgré la guerre qui faisait rage, Mesamore voulait toujours que nous envisagions un avenir au-delà ; il n’a jamais souhaité que le royaume ne devienne que la machine de guerre impitoyable qu’il est aujourd’hui."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:60
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_c2947f18:

    # KYLISA @ sad "Now? We are all just expendable pieces for a meat grinder as we fight inch by inch for every piece of land."
    KYLISA @ sad "Aujourd’hui ? Nous ne sommes que des pions jetables pour un hachoir à viande, alors que nous combattons mètre par mètre pour chaque parcelle de territoire."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:61
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_bd6b1af1:

    # KYLISA @ talk "There are no names remembered anymore when it comes to the war council, just numbers... Numbers thrown against other numbers."
    KYLISA @ talk "On ne retient plus aucun nom au conseil de guerre, juste des chiffres... Des chiffres jetés contre d’autres chiffres."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:62
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_36931427:

    # MC @ talk "But did we have any other choice?"
    MC @ talk "Mais avions-nous un autre choix ?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:63
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_5d28ca3c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "In stopping the war? No... I feel that it was inevitable."
    KYLISA @ talk "Pour arrêter la guerre ? Non... Je pense qu’elle était inévitable."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:64
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_e82d8ab8:

    # KYLISA @ angry "In what we've {i}become{/i} trying to win this war? Absolutely."
    KYLISA @ angry "Pour ce que nous sommes {i}devenus{/i} en essayant de gagner cette guerre ? Absolument."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:66
translate fr kylisa_whoareyou_f9be3333:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Speak your mind."
    KYLISA @ talk "Parle franchement."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:73
translate fr kylisa_blessing_2e104e0a:

    # "Kylisa paused for a moment, then replied calmly:"
    "Kylisa marqua une pause un instant, puis répondit calmement :"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:74
translate fr kylisa_blessing_c2d9f055:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The gods seem to already stand by your side, [player_name!t]."
    KYLISA @ talk "Les dieux semblent déjà être à vos côtés, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:81
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_12864e63:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The old or the new?"
    KYLISA @ talk "Les anciens ou les nouveaux ?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:82
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_1d31c4e5:

    # MC @ talk "Whoever will listen."
    MC @ talk "Quiconque écoutera."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:83
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_afaa155c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I may grant you their blessing..."
    KYLISA @ talk "Je pourrais vous accorder leur bénédiction..."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:84
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_2ac6342c:

    # "She raised her head a bit, and from beneath her hood I saw a pair of glaring eyes, scanning into the very depths of my soul."
    "Elle leva légèrement la tête, et de sous sa capuche, j'aperçus une paire d'yeux étincelants, qui scrutaient les profondeurs mêmes de mon âme."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:85
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_83721d0b:

    # "A gentle, barely-noticeable pulse of energy waved through my entire body, followed by a harsh, painful jitter:"
    "Une douce impulsion d'énergie, à peine perceptible, parcourut tout mon corps, suivie d'un soubresaut brutal et douloureux :"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:86
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_28a75444:

    # BLACK "{b}THAT'S CLOSE ENOUGH.{/b}"
    BLACK "{b}C'EST ASSEZ PROCHE.{/b}"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:87
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_9dfd0bef:

    # "Kylisa took half-a step back and murmured to herself:"
    "Kylisa recula d'un demi-pas et murmura pour elle-même :"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:88
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_3b48ba2d:

    # KYLISA @ talk "That energy... It is not Demorai, yet so strong..."
    KYLISA @ talk "Cette énergie... Ce n'est pas Demorai, pourtant si forte..."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:89
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_f9a3b82b:

    # "She recomposed herself and concluded:"
    "Elle se recomposa et conclut :"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:90
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_f6b8311c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I don't know what exactly you came in contact with, [player_name!t], but I might be able to help."
    KYLISA @ talk "Je ne sais pas exactement avec quoi tu es entré en contact, [player_name!t], mais je pourrais peut-être t'aider."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:91
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_e98a2fd8:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I believe I can douse this... black flame that is devouring your soul."
    KYLISA @ talk "Je crois que je peux étouffer cette... flamme noire qui dévore ton âme."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:92
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_cdf02e73:

    # "I gulped at the 'devouring' part."
    "J'ai dégluti en entendant 'dévore'."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:93
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_df3a112b:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I can only do so much as to set back it's {i}progress{/i}."
    KYLISA @ talk "Je ne peux que faire reculer sa {i}progression{/i}."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:94
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_d7f274bb:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Five hundred coin."
    KYLISA @ talk "Cinq cents pièces."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:97
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_1d60de78:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I can help you douse the black flame, [player_name!t]."
    KYLISA @ talk "Je peux t'aider à étouffer la flamme noire, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:98
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_38174cec:

    # KYLISA @ talk "You should seek a more... permanent solution though, for I can see the flame leaving it's scorching marks on your soul as we speak."
    KYLISA @ talk "Tu devrais chercher une solution plus... permanente cependant, car je peux voir la flamme laisser ses marques brûlantes sur ton âme en ce moment même."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:99
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_d7f274bb_1:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Five hundred coin."
    KYLISA @ talk "Cinq cents pièces."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:101
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_4f3629c4:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I cannot do this again, [player_name!t]."
    KYLISA @ talk "Je ne peux pas refaire ça, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:102
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_9e0beb61:

    # KYLISA @ talk "I need to regain my strength."
    KYLISA @ talk "J'ai besoin de retrouver mes forces."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:103
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_70884999:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Come find me tomorrow, I will help you with your... condition."
    KYLISA @ talk "Viens me trouver demain, je t'aiderai avec ton... état."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:104
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_6188caea:

    # MC @ talk "I see."
    MC @ talk "Je vois."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:110
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_27517054:

    # "Pain began to quickly consume my body just as Kylisa raised her staff and pointed it at me:"
    "La douleur commença à consumer rapidement mon corps juste au moment où Kylisa leva son bâton et le pointa vers moi :"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:118
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_2a9f7495:

    # KYLISA @ talk "It is done."
    KYLISA @ talk "C'est fait."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:119
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_700ec46a:

    # "Feeling refreshed and... in control again, I exhaled."
    "Me sentant rafraîchi et... de nouveau en contrôle, j'expirai."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:120
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_ec3d2f8f:

    # MC @ talk "Thanks, Kylisa."
    MC @ talk "Merci, Kylisa."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:121
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_3b24004c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "It is my pleasure, [player_name!t]."
    KYLISA @ talk "Tout le plaisir est pour moi, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:124
translate fr kylisa_cleansing_51095b9f:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Very well."
    KYLISA @ talk "Très bien."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:128
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_585e28d8:

    # KYLISA @ talk "One would hope your education would have taught you this already."
    KYLISA @ talk "On pourrait espérer que ton éducation t'ait déjà appris cela."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:129
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_47f46502:

    # MC @ talk "It has been some time since I last read the holy text... I could do with a refresher."
    MC @ talk "Cela fait un certain temps que je n'ai pas lu le texte sacré... J'aurais bien besoin d'une révision."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:130
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_4913f092:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Very well, what do you wish to know about?"
    KYLISA @ talk "Très bien, sur quoi souhaites-tu en savoir plus ?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:133
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_fd8d020e:

    # KYLISA @ talk "In the beginning, Al'Vazah, the great creator, formed the old gods and gave them dominion across the stars."
    KYLISA @ talk "Au commencement, Al'Vazah, le grand créateur, forma les anciens dieux et leur donna la domination sur les étoiles."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:134
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_82262e83:

    # KYLISA @ talk "As life flourished, the old gods grew accustomed to their worship, and saw themselves as higher beings who became obsessed with their own power games against each other."
    KYLISA @ talk "Alors que la vie s'épanouissait, les anciens dieux s'habituèrent à leur culte et se considérèrent comme des êtres supérieurs, obsédés par leurs propres jeux de pouvoir les uns contre les autres."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:135
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_3f1a19fe:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The old gods would often toy with those they viewed as lesser beings, and could only be roused to help with the offer of bargains and sacrifices."
    KYLISA @ talk "Les anciens dieux jouaient souvent avec ceux qu'ils considéraient comme des êtres inférieurs, et ne se laissaient inciter à aider que par des offrandes et des sacrifices."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:136
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_d2783f91:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Al'Vazah, displeased with what had become of the old gods, formed the new gods and also gave them powerful dominions to rule across the stars."
    KYLISA @ talk "Al'Vazah, mécontent de ce qu'étaient devenus les anciens dieux, forma les nouveaux dieux et leur donna également de puissantes dominations à gouverner à travers les étoiles."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:137
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_581b3849:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The new gods in contrast, believed it was their duty to guide the mortal races to a higher state of being."
    KYLISA @ talk "Les nouveaux dieux, en revanche, croyaient qu'il était de leur devoir de guider les races mortelles vers un état d'être supérieur."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:138
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_7964fec4:

    # KYLISA @ talk "They openly chose to walk amongst us, and pull back the veil of secrecy that the old gods always maintained."
    KYLISA @ talk "Ils choisirent ouvertement de marcher parmi nous et de lever le voile de secret que les anciens dieux maintenaient toujours."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:139
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_b4f9b1d2:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Threatened, the old gods battled the new gods for supremacy in a great war we now know as the first war of the gods."
    KYLISA @ talk "Menacés, les anciens dieux combattirent les nouveaux dieux pour la suprématie dans une grande guerre que nous connaissons désormais comme la première guerre des dieux."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:140
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_69aae19d:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The new gods emerged victorious, led Al'Vazah's champion and the most powerful of all the gods, Tzenvachican."
    KYLISA @ talk "Les nouveaux dieux sortirent victorieux, menés par le champion d'Al'Vazah et le plus puissant de tous les dieux, Tzenvachican."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:141
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_2257425a:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The old gods agreed to an uneasy truce talk, their dominion greatly reduced as the new gods triumphed over them."
    KYLISA @ talk "Les anciens dieux acceptèrent une trêve précaire, leur domination grandement réduite alors que les nouveaux dieux triomphaient d'eux."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:142
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_7cf2ca4a:

    # KYLISA @ talk "And thus began the longest long golden age of history till Malakai's war."
    KYLISA @ talk "Et ainsi commença le plus long âge d'or de l'histoire, jusqu'à la guerre de Malakai."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:145
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_9b93dd68:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Over at least ten thousand years had passed since the end of the first War of the gods."
    KYLISA @ talk "Plus de dix mille ans s'étaient écoulés depuis la fin de la première Guerre des dieux."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:146
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_83ff4786:

    # KYLISA @ talk "It is said, the uneasy peace between the old gods and the new had become more strenuous than ever, as the old gods had begun to rally around their own Champion, Shal'krin who they saw might restore them to former glory."
    KYLISA @ talk "On dit que la paix précaire entre les anciens dieux et les nouveaux était devenue plus tendue que jamais, car les anciens dieux avaient commencé à se rallier autour de leur propre Champion, Shal'krin, qu'ils voyaient capable de leur restaurer leur gloire d'antan."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:147
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_ca20eac1:

    # KYLISA @ talk "But it was not Shal'Krin who bought about the second war of the gods."
    KYLISA @ talk "Mais ce n'est pas Shal'Krin qui provoqua la seconde guerre des dieux."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:148
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_87e758b6:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Malakai the curious and kind, was decieved by the goddess of chaos, Gimera, that the only way to prevent the coming war was to open the Necronimis, a ancient box formed and sealed away by Al'Vazah at the start of his great creation."
    KYLISA @ talk "Malakai le curieux et bon, fut trompé par la déesse du chaos, Gimera, qui lui fit croire que la seule façon d'empêcher la guerre imminente était d'ouvrir le Necronimis, une ancienne boîte formée et scellée par Al'Vazah au début de sa grande création."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:149
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_0330a784:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Malakai opened the box hoping to learn the knowledge inside and use it for good, but instead, he absorbed all the darkness and evils of life itself."
    KYLISA @ talk "Malakai ouvrit la boîte espérant apprendre la connaissance qu'elle contenait et l'utiliser pour le bien, mais au lieu de cela, il absorba toutes les ténèbres et les maux de la vie elle-même."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:150
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_05c3b3b7:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Reborn as Malakai the deciever, the dark shifter, the prince of blood and the lord of darkness."
    KYLISA @ talk "Renaissant en tant que Malakai le trompeur, le changeur des ténèbres, le prince du sang et le seigneur des ténèbres."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:151
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_edff8c10:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Malakai overthrew Shal'Krin and declared himself god of gods, declaring war against Al'Vazah and Tzenvachian."
    KYLISA @ talk "Malakai renversa Shal'Krin et se proclama dieu des dieux, déclarant la guerre contre Al'Vazah et Tzenvachian."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:152
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_707d5d08:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Both old and new gods become factioned within themselves, taking sides either with Tzenvachian's forces or with Malakai's."
    KYLISA @ talk "Les dieux anciens comme nouveaux se divisèrent en factions internes, prenant parti soit pour les forces de Tzenvachian, soit pour celles de Malakai."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:153
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_469a5e24:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Brother slew brother, and old enemies now found themselves fighting shoulder to shoulder."
    KYLISA @ talk "Frère tua frère, et d'anciens ennemis se retrouvèrent à combattre côte à côte."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:154
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_b06b04db:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Some followed Malakai out of fear, while others, genuinely believed in the warped vision of the mad god that he alone could bring about the {i}perfect{/i} world."
    KYLISA @ talk "Certains suivirent Malakai par peur, tandis que d'autres croyaient sincèrement à la vision déformée du dieu fou selon laquelle lui seul pouvait instaurer le monde {i}parfait{/i}."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:155
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_a4c8291c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "While little is fully understood of what happened next, we know that thousands of mortal races joined the great war, and world upon world was engulfed in flames."
    KYLISA @ talk "On comprend encore mal ce qui se passa ensuite, mais nous savons que des milliers de races mortelles rejoignirent la grande guerre, et monde après monde furent engloutis par les flammes."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:156
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_e1af33ed:

    # KYLISA @ talk "The gods that had once flourished, were decimated, until finally, Malakai himself faced off with Tzenvachian."
    KYLISA @ talk "Les dieux qui avaient autrefois prospéré furent décimés, jusqu'à ce que finalement, Malakai lui-même affrontât Tzenvachian."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:157
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_f08591e2:

    # KYLISA @ talk "There battle, as it was written, is beyond our comprehension, but the result seems to be that Malakai's physical form was destroyed at the cost of both Tzenvachian sacrificing himself by trapping their souls in some eternal battle."
    KYLISA @ talk "Leur combat, tel qu'il est écrit, dépasse notre compréhension, mais il semble que la forme physique de Malakai fut détruite, au prix du sacrifice de Tzenvachian qui emprisonna leurs âmes dans un combat éternel."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:158
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_4abad51c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Thus ending the second war of the gods."
    KYLISA @ talk "Mettant ainsi fin à la seconde guerre des dieux."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:161
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_37a59d9c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Hmm, not much is written on this part."
    KYLISA @ talk "Hmm, il n'y a pas grand-chose d'écrit sur cette partie."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:162
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_a03c6b89:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Only the passing words of troubled surviving gods who have, throughout the ages, passed through our world and alluded to what happened."
    KYLISA @ talk "Seules les paroles fugaces des dieux survivants tourmentés qui, à travers les âges, ont traversé notre monde et ont fait allusion à ce qui s'est passé."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:163
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_372845a7:

    # KYLISA @ talk "But it's... difficult to always decipher their meaning."
    KYLISA @ talk "Mais il est... difficile de toujours déchiffrer leur sens."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:164
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_b323444e:

    # MC @ talk "What do you mean?"
    MC @ talk "Que voulez-vous dire ?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:165
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_af75ed5d:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Do keep in mind, much of this is heavily debated by scholars and such, I cannot speak from official doctrine when I discuss it."
    KYLISA @ talk "Gardez à l'esprit que la plupart de cela est fortement débattu par les érudits et autres, je ne peux pas m'exprimer à partir d'une doctrine officielle lorsque j'en discute."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:166
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_5bae4f2d:

    # KYLISA @ talk "From the various legends and smaller texts I have gathered, some of the scarred surviving gods explained that the old wars were fought with 'mechanical dragons that surfed the stars' and other such strange things."
    KYLISA @ talk "D'après les diverses légendes et les textes mineurs que j'ai rassemblés, certains des dieux survivants marqués de cicatrices ont expliqué que les anciennes guerres furent menées avec des 'dragons mécaniques qui surfaient sur les étoiles' et d'autres choses étranges de ce genre."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:167
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_9c944004:

    # KYLISA @ talk "These dragons they struggled to feed in the aftermath of the war, and as food and other resources dwindled, they fought amongst each other for what very little remained."
    KYLISA @ talk "Ces dragons, ils peinaient à les nourrir au lendemain de la guerre, et à mesure que la nourriture et les autres ressources diminuaient, ils se battaient entre eux pour le très peu qui restait."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:168
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_0132bbc2:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Apparently it was the darkest of times..."
    KYLISA @ talk "Apparemment, ce furent les temps les plus sombres..."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:169
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_48a85e92:

    # "Kylisa smiled."
    "Kylisa sourit."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:170
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_1f4113f5:

    # KYLISA @ smile "We don't know for sure about that part."
    KYLISA @ smile "Nous n'en sommes pas sûrs pour cette partie."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:171
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_828e0014:

    # KYLISA @ smile "Mechanical dragons flying through the stars... What a strange idea."
    KYLISA @ smile "Des dragons mécaniques volant à travers les étoiles... Quelle idée étrange."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:172
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_9b93778a:

    # KYLISA @ smile "I do wonder sometimes what the gods could have meant by that."
    KYLISA @ smile "Je me demande parfois ce que les dieux ont bien pu vouloir dire par là."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:175
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_ea6b7d7e:

    # KYLISA @ talk "As you wish."
    KYLISA @ talk "Comme vous voulez."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:176
translate fr kylisa_teachmeaboutgods_menu_ff8a948b:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Anything else?"
    KYLISA @ talk "Autre chose ?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:184
translate fr nov_kylisa_firstmeet_2c51f77f:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Ah, it is good to see you walking."
    KYLISA @ talk "Ah, c'est bon de te voir marcher."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:185
translate fr nov_kylisa_firstmeet_68041ff4:

    # MC @ talk "Huh? Have we met before?"
    MC @ talk "Hein ? Nous sommes-nous déjà rencontrés ?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:186
translate fr nov_kylisa_firstmeet_c69e673f:

    # KYLISA @ smile "Have you forgotten so quickly when I helped tend to your wounds?"
    KYLISA @ smile "As-tu oublié si vite quand je t'ai aidé à soigner tes blessures ?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:187
translate fr nov_kylisa_firstmeet_483c32a8:

    # "I remembered her now, the mage who arrived with Alcott."
    "Je me souviens d'elle maintenant, la mage qui est arrivée avec Alcott."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:188
translate fr nov_kylisa_firstmeet_cb39066d:

    # MC @ surprised "You're the Emperor's Mage!"
    MC @ surprised "Tu es la Mage de l'Empereur !"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:189
translate fr nov_kylisa_firstmeet_33f2b025:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Kylisa."
    KYLISA @ talk "Kylisa."

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:190
translate fr nov_kylisa_firstmeet_375219c2:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Tell me, what brings you here?"
    KYLISA @ talk "Dis-moi, qu'est-ce qui t'amène ici ?"

# game/data/characters/kylisa/dialogue.rpy:191
translate fr nov_kylisa_firstmeet_021d7d2c:

    # KYLISA @ talk "Have you come to pray to the gods?"
    KYLISA @ talk "Es-tu venu prier les dieux ?"

